===Alternative forms===
* (''regional''): {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|брез}}, {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|през}}, {{l|sh|preza}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*bez}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*bʰeǵʰ-}}

===Preposition===
{{sh-preposition|head=бѐз|c|bez|bèz}}

# (''with genitive'') [[without]], [[excluding]], not [[count]]ing
#: без сумње — without a doubt
#: остати без нечега — to lose something
#: без обзира на.. — regardless of.., no matter what..is
#: без краја и конца — endlessly
#: не без разлога — not without a reason
#: без срца — heartlessly
#: без р(иј)ечи — without a word
#: бити без нечега — to be lacking in, to be deficient in

====Related terms====
* {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|без-}}, {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|бес-}}

